text = "• Pick your academic Major with unique team colors and campus lore!
• Roll the 3D physics die with SPACEBAR or the ROLL button.
• Land on Blue Spaces (+3 Coins) or dodge Red Spaces (-3 Coins).
• Land on Event Spaces (?) for random campus windfalls and coin showers!
• Pass or land on the Star Space with 20 Coins to earn a DEGREE STAR!
• At the end of each round, battle in a 3D Jenga mini-game showdown!
• The player with the most Stars and Coins at graduation wins!"
